cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Crypto Whitepapers Archive"
message: "If you use this archive or its extracted dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A searchable archive of 880+ cryptocurrency and blockchain whitepapers,
  predominantly from the 2016–2018 ICO era, with metadata (founders/team,
  wallet and contract addresses, social links, and publication years)
  automatically extracted from each PDF.
authors:
  - name: "Crypto Whitepapers Archive contributors"
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - blockchain
  - whitepapers
  - ICO
  - bitcoin
  - ethereum
  - dataset
  - on-chain analysis
repository-code: "https://github.com/ImMike/Crypto_Whitepapers"
url: "https://immike.github.io/Crypto_Whitepapers/"
license: MIT
